HOW TO READ THIS
  The two driftWindow blocks share every setting except the window, so comparing
  their trajectories isolates what the window does to the front -- which is the
  one thing logs/01 sweep A could not explain (16 and 64 bad, 32 good).
  A *** line means the reported flamePosition does not match the field's own
  crossing, which would be a C4d regression and must stop everything.

